nput type=\"text\" id=\"awardTitle\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Bachelor of Engineering\" required>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                    <div>\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Major / Specialization *</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"majorSpec\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Cloud Computing\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Classification *</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"classification\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. First Class Honours\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Award Date *</label>\n                        <input type=\"date\" id=\"awardDate\" class=\"input-control\" required>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n                    🔒 Sign & Register Credential\n                </button>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <p>DevOps Qualification Verification System &copy; 2026</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script src=\"/js/app.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            loadQualifications();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create dashboard.html for credential registry management","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\sr